flowchart TD
    %% See doc/data-flow/FLOWCHART_SYMBOLS.md for symbol meanings

    U[User]
    PV((Product List + Detail))
    CV((Checkout View))
    SV((Success Page))

    PC((ProductController))
    CC((CheckoutController))
    TS((TransactionService))
    FS((FeedbackService))

    DB[(Products / ProductSales / Sales / Transactions / Cards / Feedbacks)]

    U --> PV --> PC --> DB
    DB --> PC --> PV

    U --> CV --> CC --> TS --> DB
    DB --> TS --> CC --> SV

    %% Feedback is available after successful purchase
    PV --> PC --> FS --> DB
    DB --> FS --> PC --> PV
